flowchart TD
    UninstallStart([生命周期入口]) --> UninstallRecovery[执行公共 TransactionManager 恢复；失败或中断在公共图内终止]
    UninstallRecovery -->|成功；锁保持| UninstallCommand[进入当前命令]

    UninstallCommand --> UninstallDiscovery[执行公共 Agent 刷新流程；失败或中断在公共图内终止]
    UninstallDiscovery -->|成功；锁保持| UninstallTarget{具体目标在快照中，或 all 快照非空?}
    UninstallTarget -->|否| UninstallTargetFail[打印目标 Agent 未受支持或未安装，或没有已支持且已安装的 Agent] --> UninstallPreflightFail[记录预执行失败；全部目标 Agent 标记 unexecuted] --> UninstallPrintFailureSummary
    UninstallTarget -->|是| UninstallNextAgent{按快照顺序还有目标 Agent?}
    UninstallNextAgent -->|否| UninstallPrintSuccessSummary[打印 completed、failed、unexecuted 汇总] --> UninstallOK([释放锁并正常退出])
    UninstallNextAgent -->|是| UninstallFind[ConfigRepository.List；由 lifecycle 定位 Power 并处理跨类型歧义]
    UninstallFind -->|读取失败或类型歧义| UninstallFail[记录当前 Agent failed；其余标记 unexecuted]
    UninstallFind -->|清单无记录| UninstallSkip[打印未安装、无需处理；记录 completed] --> UninstallNextAgent
    UninstallFind -->|清单有记录| UninstallAdapter[Resolve 当前 Agent Adapter]
    UninstallAdapter -->|失败| UninstallFail
    UninstallAdapter -->|成功| UninstallTransaction[调用 TransactionManager.Uninstall]

    subgraph UninstallTx[TransactionManager 内部]
        UninstallTransaction --> UninstallCreateJournal[创建集中 removing journal]
        UninstallCreateJournal -->|失败| UninstallTxError[返回事务错误]
        UninstallCreateJournal -->|成功；target 存在| UninstallQuarantine[原子移动 target 到同盘 quarantine：提交点]
        UninstallCreateJournal -->|成功；target 已缺失| UninstallCommitIntent[按漂移自愈更新 journal 为 committing]
        UninstallQuarantine -->|target 在 rename 前消失| UninstallCommitIntent
        UninstallQuarantine -->|其他提交点前失败| UninstallRollbackIntent[更新 journal 为 rolling-back]
        UninstallRollbackIntent --> UninstallRollback[恢复安全的事务前状态]
        UninstallRollback -->|成功| UninstallDeleteRolledBack[删除 journal；返回原始错误] --> UninstallTxError
        UninstallRollback -->|失败| UninstallKeepRollback[保留 journal；返回回滚错误] --> UninstallTxError
        UninstallQuarantine -->|rename 成功| UninstallCommitIntent
        UninstallCommitIntent -->|失败| UninstallKeepCommit[保留 journal；返回提交后错误] --> UninstallTxError
        UninstallCommitIntent -->|成功| UninstallManifest[ConfigRepository.Remove 清单记录]
        UninstallManifest -->|失败| UninstallKeepCommit
        UninstallManifest -->|成功| UninstallCleanup[删除 quarantine 并清理同盘事务目录]
        UninstallCleanup -->|失败| UninstallKeepCommit
        UninstallCleanup -->|成功| UninstallDeleteJournal[最后删除集中 journal]
        UninstallDeleteJournal -->|失败| UninstallKeepCommit
        UninstallDeleteJournal -->|成功| UninstallTxSuccess[返回成功]
    end

    UninstallTxSuccess --> UninstallRemoved[打印卸载成功；记录 completed] --> UninstallNextAgent
    UninstallTxError --> UninstallFail
    UninstallFail --> UninstallPrintFailureSummary[打印 completed、failed、unexecuted 汇总] --> UninstallBatchError([停止剩余 Agent；释放锁；非零退出])

    UninstallCreateJournal -.进程中断；保留集中 journal.-> UninstallInterrupted
    UninstallQuarantine -.进程中断；恢复器结合 removing 与路径状态判定方向.-> UninstallInterrupted
    UninstallRollback -.进程中断；rolling-back 固定回滚方向.-> UninstallInterrupted
    UninstallManifest -.进程中断；committing 固定提交方向.-> UninstallInterrupted
    UninstallCleanup -.进程中断；保留集中 journal.-> UninstallInterrupted

    style UninstallTx fill:#fff4e5,stroke:#d97706,stroke-width:2px
